{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-pro-1-intro","title":"Proverbs 1 — Chapter Introduction","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":0,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":0},"content":"<p>to execute. 137:8; De 7:1,2; 32:42,43; Isa 14:22,23; Re 17:14-16 this honour. 148:14; 1Co 6:2,3; Re 3:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-1","title":"Proverbs 1:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The use of the proverbs. 7 An exhortation to fear God, and believe his word; 10 to avoid the enticings of sinners. 20 Wisdom complains of her contempt. 24 She threatens her contemners.</p>\n<p>proverbs. 10:1; 25:1; 1Ki 4:31,32; Ec 12:9; Joh 16:25 Solomon. 2Sa 12:24,25; 1Ki 2:12; 1Ch 22:9; 28:5; 29:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-2","title":"Proverbs 1:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>4:5-7; 7:4; 8:5; 16:16; 17:16; De 4:5,6; 1Ki 3:9-12; 2Ti 3:15-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-3","title":"Proverbs 1:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>receive. 2:1-9; 8:10,11; Job 22:22 equity. Heb. equities. 1Ki 3:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-4","title":"Proverbs 1:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>subtilty. 22,23; 8:5; 9:4-6; Ps 19:7; 119:130; Isa 35:8 to the. 7:7-24; 8:17,32; Ps 34:11; 119:9; Ec 11:9,10; 12:1; 2Ti 2:22 Tit 2:6 discretion. or, advisement.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-5","title":"Proverbs 1:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>wise. 9:9; 12:1; Job 34:10,16,34; Ps 119:98-100; 1Co 10:15 a man. 1Sa 25:32,33; 2Ch 25:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-6","title":"Proverbs 1:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>a proverb. Mt 13:10-17,51,52; Mr 4:11,34; Ac 8:30,31 the interpretation. or, an eloquent speech. the words. Ec 12:11 dark. Ps 49:4; 78:2; Mt 13:34,35; Heb 5:14; 2Pe 3:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-7","title":"Proverbs 1:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>fear. 9:10; Job 28:28; Ps 111:10; 112:1; Ec 12:13 beginning. or, principal part. but. 22,29,30; 5:12,13; 15:5; 18:2; Joh 3:18-21; Ro 1:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-8","title":"Proverbs 1:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>My son. 10,15; 2:1; 3:1; 7:1; Mt 9:2,22 hear. 4:1-4; 5:1,2; 6:20; 30:17; 31:1; Le 19:3; De 21:18-21; 1Sa 2:25 2Ti 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-9","title":"Proverbs 1:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>they. 3:22; 4:9; 6:20,21; 1Ti 2:9,10; 1Pe 3:3,4 an ornament. Heb. an adding. Ge 41:42; So 1:10; 4:9; Isa 3:19; Eze 16:11; Da 5:7,16,29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-10","title":"Proverbs 1:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>7:21-23; 13:20; 20:19; Ge 39:7-13; Jud 16:16-21; Ps 1:1; 50:18 Ro 16:18; Eph 5:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-11","title":"Proverbs 1:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>let us lay. 16; 12:6; 30:14; Ps 56:6; 64:5,6; Jer 5:26; Mic 7:2; Ac 23:15; 25:3 let us lurk. 18; Ps 10:8-10; 17:12; 35:7; Jer 11:19; 18:18-20; Mt 26:3,4 Joh 15:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-12","title":"Proverbs 1:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>swallow. Ps 35:25; 56:1,2; 57:3; 124:3; Jer 51:34; La 2:5,16; Mic 3:2,3 as the. Ps 5:9; Ro 3:13 whole. Nu 16:30-33; 26:10; Ps 28:1; 143:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-13","title":"Proverbs 1:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>19; Job 24:2,3; Isa 10:13,14; Jer 22:16,17; Na 2:12; Hag 2:9 Lu 12:15; 1Ti 6:9,10; Re 18:9-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-15","title":"Proverbs 1:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>walk. 4:14,15; 9:6; 13:20; Ps 1:1; 26:4,5; 2Co 6:17 refrain. 4:27; 5:8; Ps 119:101; Jer 14:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-16","title":"Proverbs 1:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>4:16; 6:18; Isa 59:7; Ro 3:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-17","title":"Proverbs 1:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>in vain. 7:23; Job 35:11; Isa 1:3; Jer 8:7 sight of any bird. Heb. eyes of everything that hath a wing.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-18","title":"Proverbs 1:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>5:22,23; 9:17,18; 28:17; Es 7:10; Ps 7:14-16; 9:16; 55:23; Mt 27:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-19","title":"Proverbs 1:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>every. 15:27; 23:3,4; 2Sa 18:11-13; 2Ki 5:20-27; Jer 22:17-19; Mic 2:1-3 Mic 3:10-12; Hab 2:9; Ac 8:19,20; 1Ti 3:3; 6:9,10; Jas 5:1-4 2Pe 2:3,14-16 taketh. Job 31:39; Ec 5:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-20","title":"Proverbs 1:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Wisdom. Heb. Wisdoms, that is, excellent wisdom. Mt 13:54; Lu 11:49; 1Co 1:24,30; Col 2:3 crieth. 8:1-5; 9:3; Joh 7:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-21","title":"Proverbs 1:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>9:3; Mt 10:27; 13:2; Joh 18:20; Ac 5:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-22","title":"Proverbs 1:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>How. 6:9; Ex 10:3; 16:28; Nu 14:27; Mt 17:17 ye simple. 7:7; 9:4-6,16-18; Ps 94:8; Mt 9:13; 11:29,30; 23:37; Lu 19:42 Re 22:17 the scorners. 3:34; 14:6; 15:12; 19:29; 21:11; Job 34:7; Ps 1:1; 2Pe 3:3 fools. 7,29; 5:12; Joh 3:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-23","title":"Proverbs 1:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Turn. Isa 55:1-3,6,7; Jer 3:14; Eze 18:27-30; 33:11; Ho 14:1; Ac 3:19 Ac 26:20 my reproof. 25,30; 6:23; 10:17; 12:1; 29:1; Ps 145:1; Re 3:19 behold. Isa 32:15; 45:8; Joe 2:28; Zec 12:10; Lu 11:13; Joh 7:36,37 Ac 2:36-38; Re 3:16-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-24","title":"Proverbs 1:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>I have called. Isa 50:2; 65:12; 66:4; Jer 7:13; Eze 8:18; Zec 7:11,12; Mt 22:5,6 Mt 23:37,38; Heb 12:25,26 stretched. Ps 31:20; Ac 4:30; Ro 10:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-25","title":"Proverbs 1:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>ye. 30; 2Ch 36:16; Ps 107:11; Lu 7:30 would. 30; 5:12; 12:1; Ps 81:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-26","title":"Proverbs 1:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>Jud 10:14; Ps 2:4; 37:13; Lu 14:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-27","title":"Proverbs 1:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>your fear. 3:25,26; 10:24,25; Ps 69:22-28; Lu 21:26,34,35; 1Th 5:3 Re 6:15-17 as a. Ps 58:9; Isa 17:13; Na 1:3 distress. Lu 21:23-25; Ro 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-28","title":"Proverbs 1:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>shall they. Ge 6:3; Job 27:9; 35:12; Ps 18:41; Isa 1:15; Jer 11:11; 14:12 Eze 8:18; Mic 3:4; Zec 7:13; Mt 7:22,23; 25:10-12; Lu 13:25-28 Jas 4:3 they shall seek. Ps 78:34-36; Ho 5:15; 6:1-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-29","title":"Proverbs 1:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>that. 22; 5:12; 6:23; Job 21:14,15; Ps 50:16,17; Isa 27:11; 30:9-12 Joh 3:20; Ac 7:51-54 not. Lu 10:42; Heb 11:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-30","title":"Proverbs 1:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>25; Ps 81:11; 119:111,173; Jer 8:9; Lu 14:18-20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-31","title":"Proverbs 1:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>14:14; 22:8; Job 4:8; Isa 3:10,11; Jer 2:19; 6:19; Ga 6:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-32","title":"Proverbs 1:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>the turning. 8:36; Joh 3:36; Heb 10:38,39; 12:25 and the. De 32:15-44; Ps 69:22; 92:6,7; Lu 12:16-21; 16:19-25; Heb 12:8 Jas 5:5 prosperity. or, ease. Jer 48:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-1-33","title":"Proverbs 1:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>whoso. 8:32-35; 9:11; Ps 25:12,13; 81:13; Isa 48:18; 55:3; Mt 17:5 Joh 10:27-29; 1Pe 1:5 and shall. 3:21-26; 14:26; Ps 112:7; Isa 26:3; Lu 21:9,19; Ro 8:35-39</p>"}]}